{"suttaId":"tha-ap494","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2549,2569],"vripara":"8"},"segments":{"tha-ap494:0.3":"Paṃsukūlapūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap494:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, udaṅgaṇo nāma pabbato;","tha-ap494:1.3":"Tatthaddasaṃ paṃsukūlaṃ, dumaggamhi vilambitaṃ.","tha-ap494:2.1":"“Tīṇi kiṅkaṇipupphāni, ocinitvānahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap494:2.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, paṃsukūlamapūjayiṃ.","tha-ap494:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap494:3.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap494:4.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap494:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pūjitvā arahaddhajaṃ.","tha-ap494:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap494:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap494:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap494:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā paṃsukūlapūjako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap494:9.1":"Paṃsukūlapūjakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
